[gd_scene load_steps=5 format=3]

; The training area: the proving ground, the hero, the camera, and a row of
; practice dummies at varying distances so lock-on range and reticle framing
; can be exercised by eye. Owned by the orchestrator as a test fixture.
;
; Post A sits inside K.LOCK_RANGE (8.49 m), post C sits outside it and post B
; straddles the edge — so "which of these can I lock?" is a visible question.

